  "obligation": "Instantiate modules independently of executable entries, preserving rooted scalar bindings in function-free modules without creating dummy functions or weakening script-entry validation.",
  "representation": "WasmModule owns shared residual, signature and global tables. WasmFunction derives a valid index view; WasmInstance roots module bindings without selecting a function. Shared frontend lowers module facts once. Empty function tables validate only for Wasm; ordinary execute rejects absent entries before resetting the VM. No opcode or residual format version change.",
